Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.32,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.66,0:00:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.72,0:00:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found tons and tons of control spires,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.68,0:01:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we decided not to leave again until we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.72,0:01:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,destroyed the Digimon\NEmperor's headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.02,0:01:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We told our parents we were going camping,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.08,0:01:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the older kids went\Nfor real to cover for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.80,0:01:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon Emperor's base had\Nvanished, and Yoli went ballistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.48,0:01:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She and Hawkmon were attacked by\NDokugumon, and Hawkmon was badly hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.60,0:01:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli felt so bad, she told us to go\Non and look for the base without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.18,0:01:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hawkmon woke up, and they saw the Digimon\NEmperor's base floating in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.98,0:02:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he can make his base fly,\Nwho knows what else he can do?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.64,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(317,317)}The Synthetic Beast, Chimeramon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.94,0:02:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does Davis always snore\Nlike that? Every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.18,0:02:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you sleep? I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.60,0:02:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are those guys going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.84,0:02:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still think we should have\Ntold the others before we left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.40,0:02:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may be none of my beeswax, but why\Ndidn't you ask Davis to come with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.30,0:02:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to leave Kari\Nand Yoli alone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.58,0:02:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, he'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.22,0:02:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad I'm not going\Nto be the one to tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.58,0:02:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The email says they figured out which\Nway the Digimon Emperor is heading.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.26,0:02:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.34,0:02:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean they left without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.72,0:02:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come nobody wants\Nto go anywhere with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.72,0:02:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Davis, it could be you're snoring.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.72,0:02:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it finished yet, Master? Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.46,0:02:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still have a few minor details.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should he have forearms or six?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.22,0:03:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Decisions, decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.48,0:03:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're getting an update from Kari.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any of you know how to catch a fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I had a TV dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.64,0:03:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, all I have to do is take\Nthe bus To the campsite and Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.10,0:03:23.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't go. I want to get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.38,0:03:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we tell Davis we're leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.80,0:03:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, he'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.98,0:03:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is everyone leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.18,0:03:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he my snoring?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.46,0:03:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been flying for hours\Nand haven't seen a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.28,0:03:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll check with Cody and\Nsee if he's seen anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.42,0:03:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did TK say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.28,0:03:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They haven't spotted\Nanything from up above.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.78,0:03:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we haven't seen much of\Nanything either except seaweed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.98,0:03:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.12,0:03:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.69,0:03:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's dig a little further.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing is enormous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.64,0:03:58.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes Texas look like Rhode Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.66,0:04:00.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to be the Digimon Emperor's base.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.96,0:04:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let T.K. know that we found it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.74,0:04:06.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's from Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They found the base and are going to try\Nand sneak in through an underwater cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.46,0:04:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That sounds kind of dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.20,0:04:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they should wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.08,0:04:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K., look! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.82,0:04:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A whirlpool! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll get sucked right into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.00,0:04:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, looks like it's finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.66,0:04:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.90,0:04:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A new way to hypnotize your slaves?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.76,0:04:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.10,0:04:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might call it a gateway to the\Nsource of the powers of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.44,0:04:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for simplicity's sake, let's\Njust call it the Dark Pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.42,0:04:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's caused by an evil Digimon,\Nand if I can tap into its power,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.18,0:04:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I'll have everything I need\Nto complete my very own Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.48,0:04:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Master, don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.20,0:04:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.14,0:04:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it feels like evil itself\Nis coming from that dark pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.04,0:05:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't feel it because\Nyou're not a Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.32,0:05:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.30,0:05:05.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to stop my master plan\Nbecause of a silly feeling of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.72,0:05:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But on the evil scale of one to\Nten, that dark pool is real evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.98,0:05:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:12.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you stay away from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.36,0:05:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the meantime, I've got things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.52,0:05:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't ignore me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.52,0:05:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry. How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.64,0:05:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A huge whirlpool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.34,0:05:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Cody and Submarimon\Nare inside the base.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.72,0:05:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to warn them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.14,0:05:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to contact them with the D3.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.38,0:05:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think I've tried that already?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something seems to be\Nblocking the transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.38,0:05:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't just hover here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.18,0:05:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentamont's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.17,0:05:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.74,0:05:42.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.65,0:05:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you guys feeling okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.48,0:05:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I think I might be getting a\Nbug, but other than that, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.40,0:05:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am feeling a little strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.02,0:05:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you, T .K.?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.14,0:05:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not really sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.74,0:06:00.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.65,0:06:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel kind of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.18,0:06:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't they have an\Nescalator in this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.32,0:06:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My thoughts exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.28,0:06:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has to be the engine room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.46,0:06:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we destroy this\Nplace once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.42,0:06:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will, but let's take\Na look around first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.18,0:06:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, if you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:30.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you think it's\Nkind of cold in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.78,0:06:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not especially.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.18,0:06:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's weird, because I just\Ncan't seem to warm myself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.86,0:06:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chill of evil's in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.42,0:06:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.44,0:06:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what this place needs?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.32,0:06:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More window space.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.62,0:06:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.22,0:06:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master, I know you\Nhardly ever listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.64,0:06:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, you never listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.44,0:06:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But please, just this once, do it, I ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.96,0:06:51.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.54,0:06:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I wasn't listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.06,0:07:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.36,0:07:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And heading for the whirlpool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.62,0:07:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.82,0:07:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon look this place is like a prison
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.20,0:07:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it must be where the\Ndigimon emperor keeps all
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.50,0:07:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of his captured slaves\Ni guess you guys didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have a very good lawyer\Nso what are we gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.70,0:07:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do about him this is\Nmore important than the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.68,0:07:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,engine room you'd better\Narmor digivolve and break
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.46,0:07:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the bars open now that's\Na good idea digi armor
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.04,0:07:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh what is that thing\Nmy thoughts precisely
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.46,0:07:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, into the dark whirlpool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.54,0:07:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh it's not that funny thanks\Nfor the lift grandpa i can't
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.94,0:07:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,believe they left without taking\Nme so you're going camping
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.24,0:07:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's nice we used to do\Nlots of camping didn't we dear
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.96,0:07:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yeah until that time i used\Npoison ivy instead of toilet paper
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.20,0:08:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hmmm davis what are you doing i'm\Nthinking about how we can make a canoe
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.46,0:08:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,out of this tree great how are we gonna\Ndo it first we push this tree down
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.14,0:08:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a little too hard pizza canoe\Nah smell that salt there
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.26,0:08:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Davis, how come we're on\Nland and I'm getting seasick?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.88,0:08:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the biggest mobile\Nhome I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.16,0:08:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be impossible to find parking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.14,0:08:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.16,0:08:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to find the cave that Cody\Nand Armadimon used to get inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.52,0:08:48.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.43,0:08:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They might be in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.46,0:08:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place feels evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.56,0:08:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.94,0:09:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't pay any attention to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just trying to scare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.06,0:09:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They live in the Dark\NWhirlpool and feed off fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.36,0:09:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I sit up here with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.48,0:09:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, this has to be the cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master, aren't you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.22,0:09:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Initiate the attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.38,0:09:49.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.76,0:09:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.06,0:09:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.42,0:10:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sector 8, report!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.36,0:10:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sector B, come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.22,0:10:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sector C, where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.52,0:10:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were never very good at spelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want something done\Nright, do it yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.50,0:10:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.46,0:10:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.58,0:10:39.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.49,0:10:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.41,0:10:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were just setting these\Ncaptive Digimon free.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.58,0:10:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, why didn't you say so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.06,0:10:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my specialty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.10,0:10:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super Shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can just tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.30,0:10:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.00,0:11:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Pace, come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.46,0:11:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know what's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.78,0:11:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.86,0:11:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take what I need\Nfrom this Digimon Then
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.34,0:11:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my Digimon will be completed Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.32,0:11:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really believe you can\Ncontrol the powers of darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.28,0:11:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.06,0:11:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am here to warn you Beware the darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.38,0:11:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beware the darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.06,0:11:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the Digimon Emperor I\Nrule this world And some voice
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.58,0:11:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,comes out of nowhere and tells\Nme to beware the darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.44,0:11:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who does he think he's kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.92,0:12:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of all the Digimon that are out\Nthere, why did it have to be Devimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.52,0:12:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget our\Nbattle four years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.36,0:12:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon faced Devimon one-on-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.40,0:12:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was our last chance to\Ndefeat Devimon once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.32,0:12:12.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.70,0:12:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.78,0:12:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon knew what he had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.34,0:12:18.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful! Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.02,0:12:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way to completely\Ndestroy Devimon's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.70,0:12:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,evil powers was for Angemon\Nto sacrifice himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.72,0:12:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I begged him not to do it, but\Nwe both knew there was no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.86,0:12:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always felt that it was my fault,\Nthat maybe I could have done something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.88,0:12:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.24,0:12:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was too young back then\Nto know how to handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.18,0:12:53.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too young to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.84,0:12:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.26,0:12:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this is now. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.84,0:12:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay, TK?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.26,0:13:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cody, I've got some unfinished\Nbusiness to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.62,0:13:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.64,0:13:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, wait a minute. TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.04,0:13:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's he off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.40,0:13:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.28,0:13:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.19,0:13:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon will take care of TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.88,0:13:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to keep working\Nto free these Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.46,0:13:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.42,0:13:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how could he not know who i am i've told
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.58,0:13:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everybody huh well what do you know i have
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.64,0:13:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,visitors it's those kids i don't have time
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.44,0:13:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to deal with those\Nannoying brats right now
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.52,0:13:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you sure have changed master you used to\Nlove trying to destroy the digi destined it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.30,0:13:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was your favorite thing\Nto do next to putting
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.30,0:13:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coal in children's Christmas\Nstockings! Ah! Humbug!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.00,0:13:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now for the final touch. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.48,0:13:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My masterpiece is finally completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stop me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.10,0:13:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She sure can't snore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.22,0:14:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No louder than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.12,0:14:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, Davis, the rest of the\Nguys must be way ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.00,0:14:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're just gonna have to go faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.34,0:14:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still can't believe Kara did this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.90,0:14:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli, do you think Davis\Nis really mad at us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.86,0:14:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, he's a pretty good sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.80,0:14:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.14,0:14:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's headed right for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.04,0:14:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone, get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.12,0:14:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had known I was having this\Nmany guests, I would have catered.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.72,0:14:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I could still give\Nthem a party favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see what I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.24,0:14:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.80,0:15:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chimeramon is my ultimate creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.12,0:15:03.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I combine the most powerful parts of other
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.08,0:15:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon to form this\Nunstoppable fighting creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.90,0:15:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heat Viper attack will melt\Nmy enemies into oblivion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.16,0:15:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of a\NDigimon like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.40,0:15:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I get all the news\Nfrom the Underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.34,0:15:19.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Cody, while those guys do battle\Nwith him, we can free the prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.02,0:15:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.98,0:15:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I picked Kabuterimon's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't come any more hard-headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.64,0:15:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cat's eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.62,0:15:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's fast with Erdramon\Nand Andermon's wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.20,0:15:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Playtime's over. Now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.08,0:15:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw in Garurumon's legs, as\Nwell as Monochromon's tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.68,0:15:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I added Kawagamon's,\NSkullGreymon's, and Devamon's arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.16,0:16:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His body is Greymon's, and I topped\Nhim off with MetalGreymon's hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.70,0:16:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.90,0:16:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to work together as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's my VCR?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.38,0:16:18.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I wish I was taping this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.56,0:16:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a good look at him, Wormon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.64,0:16:23.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what a\Npartner should look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.00,0:16:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a scrawny runt like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.40,0:16:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's the last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.42,0:16:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, it's time we\Ngot out of here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.12,0:16:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't leave without TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.56,0:16:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get these Digimon to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.72,0:16:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.86,0:16:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, can't you do this later?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.64,0:16:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get out of here while we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.36,0:16:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be so stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.36,0:17:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't remember sending\Nyou an invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.26,0:17:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must admit,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.60,0:17:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have a lot of nerve\Nsneaking into the base
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.04,0:17:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the most powerful being\Nin the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.46,0:17:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.50,0:17:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me ask you something, Itchy Joji.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.84,0:17:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's time you\Ngave up on this little charade?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.72,0:17:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.50,0:17:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say you're the most powerful\Nbeing in the digital world,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and yet you have no idea about\Nthe powers that are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.30,0:17:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a pretender.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.52,0:17:34.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're like that story\NThe Emperor's New Clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.38,0:17:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're nobody!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.90,0:17:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not like me! You will bow\Ndown before me! Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.96,0:17:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the floor is kind of dirty\Nyou will listen to me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.10,0:18:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when you can't think of anything to say\Ndo you always resort to fighting i guess
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.92,0:18:04.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's your problem you don't know when to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.60,0:18:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,talk and when to fight\Nnow's a good time to talk
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.22,0:18:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, it's\Nalso a good time to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.42,0:18:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nefertimon, Holsmon, you\Nguys be careful, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.90,0:18:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pepper Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.92,0:18:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.20,0:18:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tempest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.40,0:18:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tempest!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.31,0:18:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rosetta Stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.16,0:18:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They had no effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.00,0:18:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. Sticky net.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.76,0:18:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, bubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:18:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanna fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.14,0:19:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'd prefer a scaring contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.54,0:19:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holsmon, let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.10,0:19:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.60,0:19:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.56,0:19:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a new pet. Chimera-mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.74,0:19:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My secret weapon that's\Nnot a secret anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry if you didn't get a good look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll see him up close\Nand personal real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.32,0:19:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K.? Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.54,0:19:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.98,0:19:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi-Armor energize! Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.00,0:19:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.98,0:19:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Motimon, armor Digivolve! Ciao!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.20,0:19:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.66,0:19:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digital monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.12,0:19:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pegasmon, flying hoax.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.44,0:20:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ken, remind me where we left off the\Nnext time I'm pummeling you into oblivion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.96,0:20:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm not as cool as I think I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.48,0:20:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Off day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.84,0:20:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for me to regroup and\Ncome back stronger than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.58,0:20:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aqua Speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.56,0:20:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Pegasmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.82,0:20:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just a little horseplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.28,0:20:24.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chimeramon, stop moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.96,0:20:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take this opportunity\Nto get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.98,0:20:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.84,0:20:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's your hat back, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.28,0:20:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't want anyone to step on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.76,0:20:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's okay, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.67,0:20:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have six others just like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.00,0:20:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One for each day of the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.20,0:20:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to fight and all\Nthe action's over with!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.28,0:20:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish we'd gotten here sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.10,0:20:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other Digimon can\Nfly. Why can't I? Come on!
